<div class="key-takeaways"><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul>
<li>On the Texas coast, wind and storm surge damage are often covered by different policies: TWIA (or another windstorm policy) for wind, and an NFIP or private flood policy for surge and rising water.</li>
